jira2teams for Debian
---------------------

The package installs a static binary to /usr/bin/jira2teams and a systemd user
unit to /usr/lib/systemd/user/jira2teams.service.

Per-user Jira credentials and Teams tokens are intentionally not packaged.
Create ~/.config/jira2teams/jira2teams.env, run `jira2teams --login` once, then
enable the user service with:

  systemctl --user enable --now jira2teams.service

For boot-time operation without an interactive desktop login, enable linger for
the service account:

  sudo loginctl enable-linger "$USER"
